hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"902","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Madina fulaan se fulaan tak hurmat wala hai. Uskey darkht na kaatey jaaein aur us mein koi nai baat na nikaali jaey. Jo us mein nai baat nikaaley to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai. (Bukhari: 1867)"
"903","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madina key donon kinaron key darmiyaan meri zabaan par hurmat wala kya gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bani Haaritha key paas aey aur farmaya: Main tumhey dekhta hun ae Bani Haaritha ke tum Haram se nikal gaey ho. Phir Aap ne tawajjoh ki aur farmaya: Balke tum us mein ho. (Bukhari: 1869)"
"904","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey paas kuchh nahi hai magar Allah ki Kitaab aur ye saheefa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se: Madina Aair se fulaan tak hurmat wala hai. Jo us mein nai baat nikaaley ya nai baat nikaalney waley ko jagah dey to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai, us se na badla qabool kya jaaeyga aur na fidya. Aur farmaya: Musalmaanon ka zimma aik hai. Phir jo Musalman ka zimma todey to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai, us se na badla qabool kya jaaeyga aur na fidya. Aur jo apne aaqaaon ki ijazat key baghair qaum se dosti karey to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai, us se na badla qabool kya jaaeyga aur na fidya. (Bukhari: 1870)"
"905","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey basti ka hukm diya gaya hai jo bastiyon ko kha jaaeygi. Wo kehtey hain Yasrib aur wo Madina hai. Wo logon ko nikaalti hai jaisey bhatti lohey key mail ko nikaalti hai. (Bukhari: 1871)"
"906","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Tabook se aey yahan tak ke ham Madina par zaahir huey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye Taaba hai. (Bukhari: 1872)"
"907","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wo Madina ko uski behtareen haalat par chhor dengey, use sirf aane jaaney waley (jaanwar) aaein ge. Aap ka iraada darindon aur parindon key aane jaaney waley hain. Aur aakhir mein hashr kiye jaaney waley Muzaina key do charwaahey hongey jo Madina ka iraada kartey huey apni bakriyon ko pukaartey huey aaeingey. To wo use jangli paaeingey. Yahan tak ke jab wo Saniyat-ul-Wada tak pahunchengey to apne chehron par girengey. (Bukhari: 1874)"
"908","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Abi Zuhair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Yaman fatah hoga. To qaum aaeygi jo (oonton ko) aawaaz degi. To wo apne ghar walon aur jo unki itaat karey unhey ley kar jaaeingi. Aur Madina unkey liye behtar hai agar wo jaantey hotey. Aur Shaam fatah hoga. To qaum aaeygi jo (oonton ko) aawaaz degi. To wo apne ghar walon aur jo unki itaat karey unhey ley kar jaaeingi. Aur Madina unkey liye behtar hai agar wo jaantey hotey. Aur Iraq fatah hoga. To qaum aaeygi jo (oonton ko) aawaaz degi. To wo apne ghar walon aur jo unki itaat karey unhey ley kar jaaeingi. Aur Madina unkey liye behtar hai agar wo jaantey hotey. (Bukhari: 1875)"
"909","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak imaan Madina ki taraf simat-ta hai jaisey saanp apne bil ki taraf simat-ta hai. (Bukhari: 1876)"
"910","[AI-translation] Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Madina walon se koi chaal nahi chalega magar pighal jaaeyga jaisey namak paani mein pighalta hai. (Bukhari: 1877)"
"911","[AI-translation] Usaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina key qilon mein se aik qiley par zaahir huey aur farmaya: Kya tum dekhtey ho jo main dekhta hun? Beshak main fitnon key girney ki jaghein tumharey gharon key darmiyaan dekh raha hun jaisey baarish key girney ki jaghein. (Bukhari: 1878)"
"912","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Madina mein Maseeh Dajjaal ka khauf daakhil na hoga. Uskey us din saat darwaazey hongey, har darwaazey par do farishtey hongey. (Bukhari: 1879)"
"913","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madina key raaston par farishtey hain, us mein taoon aur na Dajjaal daakhil hoga. (Bukhari: 1880)"
"914","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Koi shehar nahi magar Dajjaal use raundega, Makkah aur Madina key siwa. Uskey raaston mein se koi raasta nahi magar us par farishtey safein baandhey uski hifaazat kartey hain. Phir Madina apne rehne walon key sath teen martaba kaanpega aur Allah har kaafir aur munaafiq ko nikaal dega. (Bukhari: 1881)"
"915","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Dajjaal key baarey mein lambi hadees sunaai. To us mein se tha jo Aap ne hamein bayan kya ke Aap ne farmaya: Dajjaal aaeyga jabke us par Madina key raaston mein daakhil hona haraam kya gaya hai. Wo Madina key baaz شورezaaron mein utrega. To uski taraf us din aik aadmi niklega jo logon mein sab se behtar ya behtareen logon mein se hai. To wo kahega: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum Dajjaal ho jiskey baarey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apni hadees sunaai thi. To Dajjaal kahega: Batao agar main isey qatl karun phir use zinda karun to kya tum muamley mein shak karogey? To wo kahengey: Nahi. To wo use qatl karega phir use zinda karega. To wo jab use zinda karega to kahega: Allah ki qasam! Main aaj se zyada baseerat wala kabhi na tha. To Dajjaal kahega: Main use qatl karunga. To wo us par qaabu na paaeyga. (Bukhari: 1882)"
"916","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Aik dehaati Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se Islam par baiat ki. Phir agley din bukhaar mein mubtala aaya aur us ne kaha: Mujhey (baiat se) alag karo. To Aap ne teen martaba inkaar kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Madina bhatti ki tarah hai jo apna mail nikaalta hai aur uska umda saaf hota hai. (Bukhari: 1883)"
"917","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Madina mein dugni barkat kar jo tune Makkah mein barkat rakhi hai. (Bukhari: 1885)"
"918","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laaey to Abu Bakr aur Bilaal bukhaar mein mubtala huey. To Abu Bakr jab unhey bukhaar pakadta to kehtey: Har shakhs apne ghar walon mein subah karta hai jabke maut uskey jootey key tasmey se zyada qareeb hai. Aur Bilaal jab un se bukhaar utarta to apni aawaaz buland kar key kehtey: Kaash mujhey maloom hota ke kya main raat guzaarunga waadi mein jabke merey gird Izkhar aur Jaleel hon. Aur kya main aik din Majanna key paaniyon par aaunga. Aur kya mujhey Shaama aur Tafeel nazar aaeinge. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Shaiba bin Rabeea aur Utba bin Rabeea aur Umayya bin Khalaf par laanat farma jaisey unhon-ne hamein hamaari zameen se wabaa ki zameen ki taraf nikaala hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Madina ko hamarey paas mehboob bana jaisey ham Makkah se mohabbat kartey hain ya us se zyada. Ae Allah! Hamaarey saa aur hamaarey mud mein barkat dey. Aur use hamaarey liye durust farma. Aur uska bukhaar Juhfa ki taraf muntaqil farma. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham Madina aey jabke wo Allah ki zameen mein sab se zyada wabaa wali thi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Buthaan behta tha ganda paani. Yaani ganda paani. (Bukhari: 1889). Rozey ki kitaab."
